                                "sense_id": "534383b4-5ac1-3f16-9a84-fabab00bdf66",
                                "text": "Several of the lately appointed missionaries are destined, with leave of Providence, to join the Karen missions; and the Committee are not without hope of reëngaging for a limited period, if the health of his family permit, the services of Mr. Binney."
                            },
                            {
