                                "example_id": "2cf05909-a29c-494a-80b9-d9534b0c71b8",
                                "sense_id": "534383b4-5ac1-3f16-9a84-fabab00bdf66",
                                "text": "The abortion fight we are gearing up for departs from the realm of uneasy compromise and reëngages the clash of absolutes."
